      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "raft  (raft.go)  —— 核心状态机\nid · Term · Vote · lead · State(角色)\nstep stepFunc(多态分派) · tick func(角色相关时钟)\nRaftLog · Prs map[id]*Progress (复制进度)\nmsgs []Message (待发送) · votes map[id]bool\nelectionElapsed / heartbeatElapsed / randomizedElectionTimeout",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0026",
      "originalText": "raft  (raft.go)  —— 核心状态机\nid · Term · Vote · lead · State(角色)\nstep stepFunc(多态分派) · tick func(角色相关时钟)\nRaftLog · Prs map[id]*Progress (复制进度)\nmsgs []Message (待发送) · votes map[id]bool\nelectionElapsed / heartbeatElapsed / randomizedElectionTimeout",
