      "text": "RaftLog  (log.go)  —— 内存日志视图\nentries[]  ·  committed ≤ applied? 不: applied ≤ committed ≤ stabled ≤ last\npendingSnapshot · storage\nunstableEntries()  →  Ready.Entries\nnextEnts() = (applied, committed]  →  Ready.CommittedEntries",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0028",
      "originalText": "RaftLog  (log.go)  —— 内存日志视图\nentries[]  ·  committed ≤ applied? 不: applied ≤ committed ≤ stabled ≤ last\npendingSnapshot · storage\nunstableEntries()  →  Ready.Entries\nnextEnts() = (applied, committed]  →  Ready.CommittedEntries",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
