      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "② rd := Ready()  —— 生成一次性快照\n• SoftState   {Lead, RaftState}  仅变化时带\n• HardState   {Term, Vote, Commit}  仅变化时带\n• Entries     = unstableEntries()  待持久化\n• Snapshot    = pendingSnapshot   待持久化/应用\n• CommittedEntries = nextEnts()   待 apply 到状态机\n• Messages    = r.msgs            待发送给其他 peer",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0043",
      "originalText": "② rd := Ready()  —— 生成一次性快照\n• SoftState   {Lead, RaftState}  仅变化时带\n• HardState   {Term, Vote, Commit}  仅变化时带\n• Entries     = unstableEntries()  待持久化\n• Snapshot    = pendingSnapshot   待持久化/应用\n• CommittedEntries = nextEnts()   待 apply 到状态机\n• Messages    = r.msgs            待发送给其他 peer",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ah",
      "autoResize": true
    },
