      "seed": 1448016699,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 78072827,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780411539029,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "不变式:  applied ≤ committed ≤ stabled ≤ last\n• committed 前移: leader maybeCommit() 取多数派 Match 中位数;  follower commitTo(min(leaderCommit, lastNew))\n• stabled 前移: 上层持久化 Entries 后, Advance() 推进\n• applied 前移: 上层 apply CommittedEntries 后, Advance() 推进\n• Entries / Snapshot 必须先落盘, 再发 Messages (保证宕机重启后状态可恢复)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "不变式:  applied ≤ committed ≤ stabled ≤ last\n• committed 前移: leader maybeCommit() 取多数派 Match 中位数;  follower commitTo(min(leaderCommit, lastNew))\n• stabled 前移: 上层持久化 Entries 后, Advance() 推进\n• applied 前移: 上层 apply CommittedEntries 后, Advance() 推进\n• Entries / Snapshot 必须先落盘, 再发 Messages (保证宕机重启后状态可恢复)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0G",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r0080",
