      "seed": 434416656,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1399985307,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780411539029,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "SoftState {Lead, RaftState}  —— 易失, 不需持久化, 仅通知上层角色/主变化\nHardState {Term, Vote, Commit}  —— 必须持久化到 WAL (崩溃恢复的最小安全集)\nHasReady/Ready 用 prevSoftSt/prevHardSt 做 diff: 严格相等才不携带 (测试用 DeepEqual)",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0080",
      "originalText": "SoftState {Lead, RaftState}  —— 易失, 不需持久化, 仅通知上层角色/主变化\nHardState {Term, Vote, Commit}  —— 必须持久化到 WAL (崩溃恢复的最小安全集)\nHasReady/Ready 用 prevSoftSt/prevHardSt 做 diff: 严格相等才不携带 (测试用 DeepEqual)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0I",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r0082",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1060,
