      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "RawNode.Step(m)  —— 网络消息入口过滤\nif IsLocalMsg(m): return ErrStepLocalMsg\n  (MsgHup/MsgBeat 不许从网络进入)\nif Prs[m.From]==nil && IsResponseMsg(m):\n  return ErrStepPeerNotFound  (丢弃陌生节点的响应)",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0086",
      "originalText": "RawNode.Step(m)  —— 网络消息入口过滤\nif IsLocalMsg(m): return ErrStepLocalMsg\n  (MsgHup/MsgBeat 不许从网络进入)\nif Prs[m.From]==nil && IsResponseMsg(m):\n  return ErrStepPeerNotFound  (丢弃陌生节点的响应)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0O",
