    {
      "id": "t0091",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 66,
      "y": 1650.125,
      "width": 408,
      "height": 123.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2051458997,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1701499835,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780411539029,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "【第一步: 处理 m.Term】\nm.Term == 0  → 本地消息(MsgHup/MsgBeat/MsgPropose), 不比较\nm.Term > r.Term:\n  · Vote/PreVote: 若 leader 租约未过期 & 非 transfer → 忽略\n  · MsgApp/Heartbeat/Snap → becomeFollower(m.Term, m.From)\n  · 其它 → becomeFollower(m.Term, None)\nm.Term < r.Term:\n  · checkQuorum/preVote & (Heartbeat|App) → 回 MsgAppResp(促其下台)\n  · MsgPreVote → 回 reject ; 否则忽略并 return",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0090",
      "originalText": "【第一步: 处理 m.Term】\nm.Term == 0  → 本地消息(MsgHup/MsgBeat/MsgPropose), 不比较\nm.Term > r.Term:\n  · Vote/PreVote: 若 leader 租约未过期 & 非 transfer → 忽略\n  · MsgApp/Heartbeat/Snap → becomeFollower(m.Term, m.From)\n  · 其它 → becomeFollower(m.Term, None)\nm.Term < r.Term:\n  · checkQuorum/preVote & (Heartbeat|App) → 回 MsgAppResp(促其下台)\n  · MsgPreVote → 回 reject ; 否则忽略并 return",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0S",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r0092",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
