      "versionNonce": 703505499,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780411539029,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "【第二步: 按消息类型分派】\nMsgHup    → 非 leader & promotable → campaign()\nMsgVote / MsgPreVote → \n   canVote && raftLog.isUpToDate(idx,term)\n   ? 投票(回 *VoteResp, 记 Vote=From, 重置 electionElapsed)\n   : 拒绝(回 *VoteResp{Reject:true})\ndefault → r.step(r, m)  ←★ 多态, 按当前 State 分派",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0092",
      "originalText": "【第二步: 按消息类型分派】\nMsgHup    → 非 leader & promotable → campaign()\nMsgVote / MsgPreVote → \n   canVote && raftLog.isUpToDate(idx,term)\n   ? 投票(回 *VoteResp, 记 Vote=From, 重置 electionElapsed)\n   : 拒绝(回 *VoteResp{Reject:true})\ndefault → r.step(r, m)  ←★ 多态, 按当前 State 分派",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0U",
      "autoResize": true
    },
