      "updated": 1780411539029,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "stepLeader(r,m)\n────────────\nMsgBeat        → bcastHeartbeat()\nMsgPropose     → appendEntry(es); bcastAppend()\n                 (有 ConfChange 校验 pendingConfIndex)\nMsgAppendResp  → 更新 Progress; maybeCommit;\n                 reject→MaybeDecrTo 回退重发\nMsgHeartbeatResp → Match<last? sendAppend;\n                 (ReadOnly: 收 ack 推进 readIndex)\nMsgTransferLeader → 目标日志最新? sendTimeoutNow\n                 : 先 sendAppend 追平\nMsgSnapStatus / MsgUnreachable → 调整 Progress",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0097",
      "originalText": "stepLeader(r,m)\n────────────\nMsgBeat        → bcastHeartbeat()\nMsgPropose     → appendEntry(es); bcastAppend()\n                 (有 ConfChange 校验 pendingConfIndex)\nMsgAppendResp  → 更新 Progress; maybeCommit;\n                 reject→MaybeDecrTo 回退重发\nMsgHeartbeatResp → Match<last? sendAppend;\n                 (ReadOnly: 收 ack 推进 readIndex)\nMsgTransferLeader → 目标日志最新? sendTimeoutNow\n                 : 先 sendAppend 追平\nMsgSnapStatus / MsgUnreachable → 调整 Progress",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0Z",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r0099",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 1770,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 168,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
