      "updated": 1780411539029,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "stepCandidate(r,m)\n────────────\nMsgPropose → 丢弃 (ErrProposalDropped)\nMsgAppend  → becomeFollower(从m.From); handleAppend\nMsgHeartbeat → becomeFollower; handleHeartbeat\nMsgSnapshot → becomeFollower; handleSnapshot\nMsg(Pre)VoteResp → poll(); VoteWon→becomeLeader\n                   VoteLost→becomeFollower\nMsgTimeoutNow → 忽略",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0099",
      "originalText": "stepCandidate(r,m)\n────────────\nMsgPropose → 丢弃 (ErrProposalDropped)\nMsgAppend  → becomeFollower(从m.From); handleAppend\nMsgHeartbeat → becomeFollower; handleHeartbeat\nMsgSnapshot → becomeFollower; handleSnapshot\nMsg(Pre)VoteResp → poll(); VoteWon→becomeLeader\n                   VoteLost→becomeFollower\nMsgTimeoutNow → 忽略",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0b",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r0101",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 1956,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 168,
      "angle": 0,
