      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "stepFollower(r,m)\n────────────\nMsgPropose → lead!=None? 转发给 lead : 丢弃\nMsgAppend  → electionElapsed=0; lead=From;\n             handleAppendEntries\nMsgHeartbeat → 重置选举钟; handleHeartbeat\nMsgSnapshot → handleSnapshot\nMsgTransferLeader → 转发给 lead\nMsgTimeoutNow → campaign(transfer) 立即选举",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0101",
      "originalText": "stepFollower(r,m)\n────────────\nMsgPropose → lead!=None? 转发给 lead : 丢弃\nMsgAppend  → electionElapsed=0; lead=From;\n             handleAppendEntries\nMsgHeartbeat → 重置选举钟; handleHeartbeat\nMsgSnapshot → handleSnapshot\nMsgTransferLeader → 转发给 lead\nMsgTimeoutNow → campaign(transfer) 立即选举",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0d",
      "autoResize": true
    },
