      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780411539029,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "【投票规则  raft.Step: case MsgVote/MsgPreVote】\ncanVote =  Vote == m.From                         // 重复投同一人\n       || (Vote == None && lead == None)          // 本任期还没投也没主\n       || (m.Type == PreVote && m.Term > Term)    // 为未来任期预投\n且  isLogUpToDate(m.LogTerm, m.Index):\n    候选人 lastLogTerm 更大, 或 term 相等且 lastIndex ≥ 本地\n投 MsgVote 后: electionElapsed=0; Vote=m.From  (PreVote 不记)\n响应里 Term 取 m.Term (PreVote 用未来任期, 避免被对端忽略)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0147",
      "originalText": "【投票规则  raft.Step: case MsgVote/MsgPreVote】\ncanVote =  Vote == m.From                         // 重复投同一人\n       || (Vote == None && lead == None)          // 本任期还没投也没主\n       || (m.Type == PreVote && m.Term > Term)    // 为未来任期预投\n且  isLogUpToDate(m.LogTerm, m.Index):\n    候选人 lastLogTerm 更大, 或 term 相等且 lastIndex ≥ 本地\n投 MsgVote 后: electionElapsed=0; Vote=m.From  (PreVote 不记)\n响应里 Term 取 m.Term (PreVote 用未来任期, 避免被对端忽略)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1N",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r0149",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 3070,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
