      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "【become* 状态转换设置  raft.go】\nbecomeFollower(term,lead): step=stepFollower, tick=tickElection,\n   reset(term), lead=lead, State=Follower\nbecomeCandidate(): step=stepCandidate, reset(Term+1),\n   tick=tickElection, Vote=self, State=Candidate\nbecomePreCandidate(): step=stepCandidate, 不动 Term/Vote,\n   ResetVotes, lead=None, State=PreCandidate\nbecomeLeader(): step=stepLeader, reset(Term), tick=tickHeartbeat,\n   lead=self, Prs[self]→Replicate, pendingConfIndex=last,\n   appendEntry(空 noop)  ← 用于尽快提交本任期\nreset(term): Term=term, Vote=None, lead=None, 清票,\n   重置 elapsed, 随机化 electionTimeout, 重建 Prs.Match/Next",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0149",
      "originalText": "【become* 状态转换设置  raft.go】\nbecomeFollower(term,lead): step=stepFollower, tick=tickElection,\n   reset(term), lead=lead, State=Follower\nbecomeCandidate(): step=stepCandidate, reset(Term+1),\n   tick=tickElection, Vote=self, State=Candidate\nbecomePreCandidate(): step=stepCandidate, 不动 Term/Vote,\n   ResetVotes, lead=None, State=PreCandidate\nbecomeLeader(): step=stepLeader, reset(Term), tick=tickHeartbeat,\n   lead=self, Prs[self]→Replicate, pendingConfIndex=last,\n   appendEntry(空 noop)  ← 用于尽快提交本任期\nreset(term): Term=term, Vote=None, lead=None, 清票,\n   重置 elapsed, 随机化 electionTimeout, 重建 Prs.Match/Next",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1P",
      "autoResize": true
    },
