      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "【时钟 tick  raft.go】\ntickElection() (Follower/Candidate):\n  electionElapsed++\n  promotable() && pastElectionTimeout() →\n     electionElapsed=0; Step(MsgHup) 发起选举\n  electionTimeout 在 [et, 2et) 间随机 → 降低选票分裂\n\ntickHeartbeat() (Leader):\n  heartbeatElapsed++; electionElapsed++\n  electionElapsed≥electionTimeout → (checkQuorum 时)\n     Step(MsgCheckQuorum); 转移超时则放弃 transferee\n  heartbeatElapsed≥heartbeatTimeout →\n     heartbeatElapsed=0; Step(MsgBeat) 广播心跳",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0151",
      "originalText": "【时钟 tick  raft.go】\ntickElection() (Follower/Candidate):\n  electionElapsed++\n  promotable() && pastElectionTimeout() →\n     electionElapsed=0; Step(MsgHup) 发起选举\n  electionTimeout 在 [et, 2et) 间随机 → 降低选票分裂\n\ntickHeartbeat() (Leader):\n  heartbeatElapsed++; electionElapsed++\n  electionElapsed≥electionTimeout → (checkQuorum 时)\n     Step(MsgCheckQuorum); 转移超时则放弃 transferee\n  heartbeatElapsed≥heartbeatTimeout →\n     heartbeatElapsed=0; Step(MsgBeat) 广播心跳",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1R",
      "autoResize": true
    },
