      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "1) Client → Leader: Propose(data)\nMsgPropose(本地) → stepLeader:\n  appendEntry(es): 写 RaftLog, Term=currentTerm\n  Prs[self].Match/Next 更新; bcastAppend()",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0161",
      "originalText": "1) Client → Leader: Propose(data)\nMsgPropose(本地) → stepLeader:\n  appendEntry(es): 写 RaftLog, Term=currentTerm\n  Prs[self].Match/Next 更新; bcastAppend()",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1b",
      "autoResize": true
    },
