      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "3) Follower.handleAppendEntries(m)\n若 m.Index<committed → Resp{Index:committed}\nmaybeAppend(prevIdx,prevTerm,...):\n  prevLog 匹配? 截断冲突 + 追加新条目\n  commitTo(min(m.Commit, lastNewIndex))\n  → Resp{Index:lastNewIndex}\n不匹配 → Resp{Reject:true, RejectHint:lastIndex}",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0166",
      "originalText": "3) Follower.handleAppendEntries(m)\n若 m.Index<committed → Resp{Index:committed}\nmaybeAppend(prevIdx,prevTerm,...):\n  prevLog 匹配? 截断冲突 + 追加新条目\n  commitTo(min(m.Commit, lastNewIndex))\n  → Resp{Index:lastNewIndex}\n不匹配 → Resp{Reject:true, RejectHint:lastIndex}",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
