      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "5) Leader.handleAppendResponse(m)\nReject: Prs.MaybeDecrTo(Index,RejectHint)\n  回退 Next → sendAppend 重试 (Probe)\nAccept: Prs.MaybeUpdate(Index) 推进 Match/Next\n  Probe→Replicate; Inflights.FreeLE(Index)\n  → maybeCommit()",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0170",
      "originalText": "5) Leader.handleAppendResponse(m)\nReject: Prs.MaybeDecrTo(Index,RejectHint)\n  回退 Next → sendAppend 重试 (Probe)\nAccept: Prs.MaybeUpdate(Index) 推进 Match/Next\n  Probe→Replicate; Inflights.FreeLE(Index)\n  → maybeCommit()",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1k",
      "autoResize": true
    },
