      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "6) maybeCommit()\n取所有 Prs.Match 排序的中位数 = 多数派已复制 index\n且 log[mci].Term == currentTerm (论文约束!)\n→ raftLog.commitTo(mci): committed 前移\n→ 下一轮 MsgAppend / Heartbeat 携带新 Commit",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0172",
      "originalText": "6) maybeCommit()\n取所有 Prs.Match 排序的中位数 = 多数派已复制 index\n且 log[mci].Term == currentTerm (论文约束!)\n→ raftLog.commitTo(mci): committed 前移\n→ 下一轮 MsgAppend / Heartbeat 携带新 Commit",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1m",
      "autoResize": true
    },
