      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "【心跳与探活】\ntickHeartbeat → MsgBeat(本地) → bcastHeartbeat\nsendHeartbeat(to): Commit=min(Prs[to].Match, committed)\n  (防止 follower 误提交它还没有的日志)\nFollower.handleHeartbeat: commitTo → MsgHeartbeatResponse\nLeader 收 HeartbeatResp: 若 Prs.Match<lastIndex → sendAppend 补日志\n心跳不携带 entries, 仅保活 + 传播 commit + (ReadOnly 读线性化)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0178",
      "originalText": "【心跳与探活】\ntickHeartbeat → MsgBeat(本地) → bcastHeartbeat\nsendHeartbeat(to): Commit=min(Prs[to].Match, committed)\n  (防止 follower 误提交它还没有的日志)\nFollower.handleHeartbeat: commitTo → MsgHeartbeatResponse\nLeader 收 HeartbeatResp: 若 Prs.Match<lastIndex → sendAppend 补日志\n心跳不携带 entries, 仅保活 + 传播 commit + (ReadOnly 读线性化)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1s",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r0180",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 4010,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 230,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
