      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780411539029,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "【Progress 复制状态机  (tracker/progress.go)】\n每个 peer 一个 Progress{ Match, Next, State, Inflights, ... }\n\nStateProbe   : 探测期, 一次只发1条试探, 收到 Resp 才继续 (paused)\n   被拒 → MaybeDecrTo 回退 Next; 收到 ack → 转 Replicate\nStateReplicate: 流水线复制, Inflights 滑动窗口限流, 持续 sendAppend\n   被拒/超时 → 退回 Probe\nStateSnapshot : follower 落后超出已压缩日志, 发 MsgSnapshot\n   PendingSnapshot 记录快照 index; 完成 → Probe → Replicate\n\nMatch: 已确认复制到该 peer 的最高 index\nNext : 下一条要发给该 peer 的 index",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r0180",
      "originalText": "【Progress 复制状态机  (tracker/progress.go)】\n每个 peer 一个 Progress{ Match, Next, State, Inflights, ... }\n\nStateProbe   : 探测期, 一次只发1条试探, 收到 Resp 才继续 (paused)\n   被拒 → MaybeDecrTo 回退 Next; 收到 ack → 转 Replicate\nStateReplicate: 流水线复制, Inflights 滑动窗口限流, 持续 sendAppend\n   被拒/超时 → 退回 Probe\nStateSnapshot : follower 落后超出已压缩日志, 发 MsgSnapshot\n   PendingSnapshot 记录快照 index; 完成 → Probe → Replicate\n\nMatch: 已确认复制到该 peer 的最高 index\nNext : 下一条要发给该 peer 的 index",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1u",
      "autoResize": true
    },
